  designNotes: 'A swapper for the other side (telekinesis, sleight of hand): target
    enemy creature trades places with its partner in the formation, so their attacks
    and spells aimed at a slot find someone else there, and you draw 1 next Day.
    Moves resolve first, so it can undo a plan they made today.'
  artDescription: A magician's white-gloved hands doing the cups-and-ball trick on
    a velvet table, but under the cups are tiny soldiers being shuffled around, one
    cup lifted to show the soldier is gone.
